---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Approach | Why Ecosoft"
  description="ERP implementation done right: business-first, technology-second. Ecosoft's 5-step methodology that has produced a 100% project success rate."
>


  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 44rem;">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our Approach</p>
        <h1>ERP implementation done right: business-first, technology-second.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">
          Most ERP failures are not technology failures. They are business-understanding failures —
          the implementor didn't grasp the client's processes, didn't map the system to actual
          workflows, and delivered something technically functional but operationally useless.
          Ecosoft is built to prevent exactly that.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5-STEP PROCESS -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Methodology</p>
        <h2>Five steps — one principle: understand before you build</h2>
        <p>Every Ecosoft project follows the same five-step process, regardless of size or platform. It's what makes our 100% success rate possible.</p>
      </header>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: start;">
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="timeline-step-number">1</div>
            <div class="timeline-step-body">
              <h3>Business Discovery</h3>
              <p>
                Before any software is opened, we spend time with your team — understanding your
                supply chain flow, your accounting structure, your approval hierarchies, your pain
                points. We document the way your business actually works, not the way a textbook
                says it should.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="timeline-step-number">2</div>
            <div class="timeline-step-body">
              <h3>Process Design</h3>
              <p>
                We design the ERP configuration around your verified business processes, not the
                other way around. Where standard modules fit perfectly, we use them. Where
                Thai-specific requirements demand customisation — VAT compliance, withholding tax,
                Thai chart of accounts — we build it properly, as reusable open-source modules.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="timeline-step-number">3</div>
            <div class="timeline-step-body">
              <h3>Phased Implementation</h3>
              <p>
                We implement in phases, starting with the processes that deliver the highest value
                fastest. This keeps your team engaged, produces visible results early, and reduces
                project risk significantly.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="timeline-step-number">4</div>
            <div class="timeline-step-body">
              <h3>Training &amp; Change Management</h3>
              <p>
                A system that your people don't understand is a system that fails. We invest heavily
                in user training — not generic software walkthroughs, but training on your specific
                configuration and your specific workflows. We also support change management so
                adoption is high from day one.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="timeline-step-number">5</div>
            <div class="timeline-step-body">
              <h3>Lifetime Partnership</h3>
              <p>
                ERP is not a one-time project. Your business grows, regulations change, and new
                modules become available. Ecosoft offers ongoing support, system evolution, and
                upgrade services so your ERP grows with you — for years, not just months.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Side panel -->
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; position: sticky; top: 6rem;">
          <div class="info-card" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 0 0.75rem 0.75rem 0;">
            <h3>Why this works</h3>
            <p>Most ERP projects skip steps 1 and 2. They jump straight to configuration and discover too late that the system doesn't match reality. Rework is expensive. Discovery is cheap.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <h3>📊 The result</h3>
            <p>40+ completed projects. 0 failures. Every client from our first year is still with us. The methodology is not theory — it is our operating record.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <h3>🇹🇭 Thai-specific expertise</h3>
            <p>Step 2 is where Thai businesses need a partner who understands local requirements. Thai VAT, withholding tax, 50 Tawi, BOI compliance — built in, not bolted on.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT THIS MEANS FOR YOU -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">What This Means for Your Project</p>
        <h2>Practical guarantees, not just promises</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">✓</span>
          <h3>No Surprises at Go-Live</h3>
          <p>Because we design around your actual processes, the system works the way your team expects. User adoption is high. Frustration is low.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">✓</span>
          <h3>On Time, On Budget</h3>
          <p>Phased delivery means you see results early and course-correct cheaply. Scope creep is managed through structured change control, not surprise invoices.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">✓</span>
          <h3>Code You Can Own</h3>
          <p>Every customisation is built as a proper module — not a hack. At project close, you receive all source code, documented and deployable by any developer.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">✓</span>
          <h3>A Partner, Not a Vendor</h3>
          <p>Step 5 is not an upsell — it's the point of the whole engagement. We commit to long-term relationships because that's how ERP actually delivers ROI.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-strip">
    <div class="container cta-strip-grid">
      <div class="cta-strip-item">
        <h3>See our approach in action</h3>
        <p>Read how we applied this methodology to satellite manufacturing, government agencies, and industrial companies.</p>
        <a href="/case-studies" class="btn btn-white">View Case Studies</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-strip-item">
        <h3>Start with a discovery conversation</h3>
        <p>The first step is free — no obligation, no sales pitch. Just an honest exploration of your business and what ERP could do for it.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-teal-outline">Book a Free Consultation →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
